  "description": "The market is soaring and we have even more bullish news coming alive",
  "body_html": "<p>For weeks, I have remained steadfast that the bull market is not over…</p><ul><li><p>To ignore the news and headlines. </p></li><li><p>To disregard the pop-up guru influencers ever since the PDT rule went away… many of which flipped bearish since their hype stocks plummeted.</p></li><li><p>That the stock market has went up through multiple conflicts and wars</p></li><li><p>The list goes on…</p></li></ul><p>As well, the likelihood of a “blue wave” in politics was incredibly likely, which was very bullish for the markets. A government in gridlock prevents most wild economic policies from coming to fruition. This creates predictability, which attracts investors… which is bullish. </p><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;caba86e6-c331-4747-8d16-0f99c566a14d&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p>Now today, the market is soaring. Our best position, Xometry, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$XMTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is approaching 60% profit (no leverage). Our regional banks are climbing steady today, and both the original StockTok ETF and <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0 (click here)</a> </strong>are continuing on with more all time highs. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png\" width=\"971\" height=\"448\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:448,&quot;width&quot;:971,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:143934,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/223481483?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mq9i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd07b1901-4ac4-4666-b8dd-757d8ca30b59_971x448.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok ETF’s soaring to new all time highs, again.</figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>But wait… there is more! We have previously discussed how government shutdowns, though terrible for the individuals enduring them, are historically great for investors. There is often times fear and a small pull back in the stock market, <em><strong>leading up </strong></em>to a government shut down. The anticipatory pullback I like to call it. But during the actual shutdown, the markets, historically, will rapidly climb. My speculation for this, is again, no wild economic policies or major geopolitical change ups can occur during these periods…creating predictability…which institutional investors love. Bullish.</p><p>This is something to monitor through November, but odds spiked last night when Democrats took over the House and Senate. I find it unlikely that any major budget agreements are going to occur, so personal speculation, is that a Government shutdown will in fact happen. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png\" width=\"881\" height=\"402\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/baf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:402,&quot;width&quot;:881,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:60156,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/223481483?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!py6V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbaf94fb3-fa23-47d7-b47e-bb0ac215a87f_881x402.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Empathy to those impacted, but for investors, government shutdowns are actually bullish. Santa rally is looking more likely…</figcaption></figure></div><p>Pretty simple post today. It is just exciting to see forecasts coming to fruition, and that staying a bull through one of the most exhausting bull markets, is paying off. I think we all needed some green candles to lift spirits, regardless of which side of the aisle you may sit on. </p><p>I remain heavily focused (and invested) in regional banks, precious metal miners, and insurance. We just sold off Hinge Health, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$HNGE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> for a +20% gain. With many stocks recovering today, I expect we will be getting aggressive with positions again as they re-develop structure. We need to get some chart structure formed, and if that happens, which I speculate it will, then we can make moves again. </p><h4>You can see<strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/here-is-my-plan-in-this-crazy-stock\">My positions and the updates (click here)</a></strong>. </h4><p>Nice work to all of those that stuck around during the bad times… that is paying off!</p><p>Now, lets get this blow off top in the bag!</p><p>If you have questions or want to talk, I will be around in the main chat for much of the day. </p><h4>Be sure to like ❤️ and re-post 🔄 ! This helps fight AI slop!</h4><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Timothy’s StockTok is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>",
